  "readme": "🎛 Patchcab Patchcab is a modular Eurorack style synthesizer made with Web Audio. Modules are built using Tone.js Web Audio framework and Svelte Javascript framework. Patchcab is heavily inspired by VCV Eurorack Simulator. 🎛 Patch and play Go to https://patch.cab to create, share and remix synths with community made modules. 💾 Run locally Install Node.js and the latest version of Patchcab core: npm install @patchcab/core Add some modules: npm install @patchcab/modules Start Patchcab: npx patchcab And finally - open the address http://localhost:3000 in your browser 🤘 🎚 Build modules Read the Patchcab documentation (coming soon 🤞) Read the Tone.js documentation Browse Patchcab default modules for basic examples Fork the Patchcab module template Share your modules on Patch.cab by making a pull request to spectrome/patch-dot-cab",
